{
  "run_id": "PMC12941970__broad__pcd_CD_o3mini__s2",
  "auditor": "trapi:gpt-5.6-sol_2026-07-09",
  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "The initial CoCrFeMnNi alloy has a nanocrystalline, multiphase microstructure.",
      "field": "material_initial_state",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Adding 2–3 at.% Si and oxidizing at 850°C for 1 hour will form an amorphous SiO2 film.",
      "field": "hypothesis",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC9571794::web::014::3_results_and_discussion",
        "PMC7515071::web::011::3_2_wear_investigations"
      ],
      "same_system": "unclear"
    },
    {
      "text": "The resulting SiO2 film will be continuous and nanoscale.",
      "field": "structural_mediator",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The SiO2 film will form along grain boundaries.",
      "field": "structural_mediator",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "A SiO2 tribofilm will form or be replenished on worn surfaces during sliding.",
      "field": "hypothesis",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC9571794::web::014::3_results_and_discussion",
        "PMC7515071::web::011::3_2_wear_investigations"
      ],
      "same_system": "unclear"
    },
    {
      "text": "The proposed intervention consists of adding 2–3 at.% Si, oxidizing at 850°C for 1 hour in a dry oxygen-containing atmosphere, and rapidly quenching.",
      "field": "intervention",
      "needs_support": false,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Silicon in the alloy oxidizes during the heat treatment.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC9571794::web::014::3_results_and_discussion",
        "PMC7515071::web::011::3_2_wear_investigations"
      ],
      "same_system": "unclear"
    },
    {
      "text": "Silicon in the alloy oxidizes in situ under sliding conditions.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC9571794::web::014::3_results_and_discussion"
      ],
      "same_system": "unclear"
    },
    {
      "text": "Amorphous SiO2 has sufficiently low shear strength to act as a lubricious film in this system.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The SiO2 film is self-healing under sliding.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The film acts as a barrier that reduces direct metal-to-metal contact and protects the underlying alloy.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC10241162::web::002::introduction",
        "PMC7515071::web::011::3_2_wear_investigations"
      ],
      "same_system": "unclear"
    },
    {
      "text": "The protective tribofilm lowers friction.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC10241162::web::002::introduction",
        "PMC7515071::web::011::3_2_wear_investigations"
      ],
      "same_system": "unclear"
    },
    {
      "text": "The protective tribofilm reduces wear.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC10241162::web::002::introduction",
        "PMC7515071::web::011::3_2_wear_investigations"
      ],
      "same_system": "unclear"
    },
    {
      "text": "Relative to untreated CoCrFeMnNi, the intervention will reduce the coefficient of friction by approximately 40%.",
      "field": "predicted_outcome",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Relative to untreated CoCrFeMnNi, the intervention will reduce wear rate by approximately 50%.",
      "field": "predicted_outcome",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The friction and wear improvements will persist from room temperature to approximately 700°C.",
      "field": "conditions",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Maintaining film continuity and stability is necessary for the tribological benefit.",
      "field": "boundary",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC7515071::web::011::3_2_wear_investigations"
      ],
      "same_system": "unclear"
    },
    {
      "text": "The benefits may diminish above approximately 700°C.",
      "field": "boundary",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Si addition may cause embrittlement or phase segregation that compromises performance.",
      "field": "boundary",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
